usiness.","context":"•Our aspirations, disclosures, and actions related to sustainability matters expose us to risks that could adversely affect our reputation and performance.","section":"•If we fail to timely and effectively obtain shipments of products from our manufacturers and deliver products to our retail partners and customers, our business and results of operations could be harmed.","block":73,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001670592-26-000013","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-27","reportDate":"2026-01-03","cik":"0001670592","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1670592/000167059226000013/yeti-20260103.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/603ff009824bebc753397d66410255e9e435397e20b62a9bc9b258ef116ed257.bin","sha256":"603ff009824bebc753397d66410255e9e435397e20b62a9bc9b258ef116ed257"}},{"id":"c0867d0f7c4e93e5cc09cb50d45fe6484759f4bd10b9d721f2dab7617f3da19b","quote":"•If the retail partners in our wholesale channel cease to promote or carry our current products, choose not to promote or carry new products that we develop, or we need to raise our discounts to such retail partners, our brand as well as our results of operations and financial condition could be harmed.","context":"•Climate change, and related legislative and regulatory responses to climate change, may adversely impact our business.","section":"•If we fail to timely and effectively obtain shipments of products from our manufacturers and deliver products to our retail partners and customers, our business and results of operations could be harmed.","block":74,"table":null,"attribution":"management","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001670592-26-000013","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-02-27","reportDate":"2026-01-03","cik":"0001670592","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1670592/000167059226000013/yeti-20260103.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/603ff009824bebc753